A '''cargo port''' was located in [[Daiyu City]] on the [[planet]] [[Daiyu]]. The port was was fully automated. After rescuing a young [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] from kidnappers, [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] escaped with Leia on a [[Transport eight|cargo shuttle]] that left from the port.<ref name="Kenobi" />

